cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use janook, please cite it as below — and cite the AVCG guidelines paper
  (Boeykens et al. 2024, https://doi.org/10.3389/fvets.2024.1497817) for the standard
  itself. The two are different things: the paper defines the guidelines, janook is one
  implementation of them. See the Citing section of the README.
title: janook
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The Janook Authors"
version: 9.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-16
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/janookgenomics/janook"
url: "https://github.com/janookgenomics/janook"
keywords:
  - variant classification
  - veterinary genetics
  - AVCG
